  "summary": "整篇形式证明尚未通过 Lean Kernel；请查看原稿锚点、编译诊断和翻译缺口，不能据此判定原数学证明错误。",
  "sourceSteps": [
    {
      "id": "source-0",
      "index": 0,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 155,
      "end": 272,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第1步。以A为原点，AC为正x轴，长度尺度固定；由于AC平分角BAD，可取实数u,v满足u²+v²=1、u>0、v>0，并取b,d,c>0，使B=(bu,bv)，D=(du,-dv)，C=(c,0)。这里b=AB、d=AD、c=AC。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_0",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-1",
      "index": 1,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 273,
      "end": 392,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第2步。因E∈BC、F∈CD且EF∥BD，依据以C为中心的相似比，存在共同参数0<t<1，使E=C+t(B-C)=(c(1-t)+tbu,tbv)，F=C+t(D-C)=(c(1-t)+tdu,-tdv)。这一步准确使用了原题的平行条件。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_1",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-2",
      "index": 2,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 393,
      "end": 483,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第3步。任何过原点且在原点切x轴的圆均有方程x²+y²+λy=0。通过B的第一圆系数λ_1=-b/v，通过D的第二圆系数λ_2=d/v，这是分别代入B,D并用u²+v²=1得到的。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_2",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-3",
      "index": 3,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 484,
      "end": 643,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第4步。由于P位于FA的延长线过A的另一侧，可写P=pF且p<0；因为P在第一圆上，代入得p²|F|²-(b/v)pF_y=0。由F_y=-tdv、p≠0，得p=-bdt/|F|²。完全类似，由Q=qE在第二圆上且E_y=tbv，得到q=-bdt/|E|²。记h=bdt，则P=-hF/|F|²、Q=-hE/|E|²。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_3",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-4",
      "index": 4,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 644,
      "end": 751,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第5步。四个互异点U_i=(x_i,y_i)共圆，当且仅当行列式det[(x_i²+y_i²,x_i,y_i,1)]_{i=1}^4=0。取顺序B,D,P,Q，并代入上面的显式坐标。分母|E|²|F|²均严格为正。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_4",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-5",
      "index": 5,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 752,
      "end": 925,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第6步。直接通分展开该4×4行列式，其分子必含因子u²+v²-1；事实上逐项整理得到行列式为 b²c d²t³ v(b-d)(t-1)(u²+v²-1)[b²(u²+v²)-2bd u²+2bd v²+d²(u²+v²)]/(|E|²|F|²)。由于u²+v²=1，该值严格等于0。代数整理仅使用第1至4步显式坐标和恒等式，无须新增原题几何假设。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_5",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-6",
      "index": 6,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 926,
      "end": 963,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第7步。因此B,D,P,Q四点位于同一个圆上，即B,P,Q,D共圆。证毕。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_6",
      "dependsOn": []
    }
  ],
